Z||000018||mrfixit58||10-12-2000||10:28 AM||||Seanh,<P>You said, "I am going to rebuild my car this Jan. and remove all the rust,...".<P>Save youself a LOT of headaches. Make a trip below the snow belt and find a rust-free car. Having restored several cars (non-Fiero) I can attest that you will likely spend more time and money trying to fix rust than to start with one without it.<P>My 2¢ worth,<BR>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
